msgid "Monitor brightness"
msgstr "The looking-glass's brightness"

msgid ""
"Strips with Follow monitor brightness on (under Brightness, on each strip) take their brightness "
"from this monitor."
msgstr ""
"Strips that defer to the looking-glass (under Brightness, on each strip) take their brightness "
"from this one."

