msgstr "Kindly install ddcutil with {how}, then have another look."

msgid "ddcutil installed. Looking for monitors…"
msgstr "ddcutil is installed. Seeking the looking-glasses…"

msgid "Not installed: the password dialog was closed."
msgstr "Not installed: the password dialogue was dismissed."

