"The LEDs fade out over 2 seconds and come back in half a second. Try it shows the lock setting "
"(or off, if that's Keep) for 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"The lamps fade over 2 seconds and return in half a second. Try it shows the lock setting (or "
"darkness, should that be Leave be) for 5 seconds."

msgid "Idle time can't be seen here: lines for hypridle or swayidle"
msgstr "One cannot see the idle time here: lines for hypridle or swayidle"

msgid ""
"Add these to your idle daemon's config, and Iridia knows when you're away (it then uses that "
"daemon's timeout instead of the minutes above)."
msgstr ""
"Add these to your idle daemon's configuration, and Iridia shall know when you have stepped away "
"(it then heeds that daemon's timeout rather than the minutes above)."

