msgstr "Efface"

msgid "Done editing"
msgstr "Amendments complete"

msgid "Colors in order (click to change):"
msgstr "Colours in order (click to change):"

msgid "Change this color"
msgstr "Change this colour"

msgid ""
"OpenRGB doesn't know how many LEDs this zone has yet, so nothing lights up. Click Count LEDs and "
"set the size there."
msgstr ""
"OpenRGB does not yet know how many lamps this zone has, so nothing is lit. Pray click Count the "
"lamps and set the size there."

msgid ""
"This device has no Direct mode, so it shows one color for the whole device (the first one of the "
"pattern)."
msgstr "This device has no Direct mode, so it wears a single colour throughout (the first of the pattern)."

